#
# File: 046-Bittorrent-udp-dport123-out-req-accept.rule
# Title: Allow local Bittorrent client request to remote Bittorrent server

# BitTorrent services (optional).
# Called by: zones/red/inet-filter-output-red-udp.chain
udp dport { $TORRENT_PORT_LAN, $TORRENT_PORT_WAN, $TRACKER_TORRENT_PORT_WAN } counter accept comment "local-to-remote BitTorrent/UDP/various request"
